      <description>&lt;p&gt;One of three primary species of Cannabis.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Tends to grow shorter.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Originates from higher latitude regions, where the summer is shorter with longer hours of light.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;It was crossed to make &lt;a href=&#34;https://weedweed.wiki/articles/autoflower/&#34;&gt;autoflowers&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;origins&#34;&gt;Origins&lt;/h2&gt;</description>
